{{!
    @template mod_classprogress/log_entries

    A table of sessions with an entry, for the log page. Each planned title opens in place to show the session's block,
    hours and plan; under it, the first line of what was done. Below md the block, status and written-on columns move
    into the row (the block and the status under the title, the late badge under the date) and the actions stack.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * rows - The sessions, each with date; hasplan, false for an unplanned session; title, block and hours (as typed,
      escaped here); content, the plan already through format_text(); done, the first line of what was done; status;
      writtenon; late, empty when not late; editurl and historyurl.
    * canedit - Whether the user may log sessions; without it, the rows have no Edit entry link.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "canedit": true,
        "rows": [{"date": "2026-10-12", "hasplan": true, "title": "Presentació", "block": "RA1", "hours": "2",
            "content": "<p>Normes de l'aula</p>", "done": "Normes explicades", "status": "Done",
            "writtenon": "2026-10-15", "late": "Late by 3 days",
            "editurl": "https://example.com/mod/classprogress/entry.php?id=1&entryid=1",
            "historyurl": "https://example.com/mod/classprogress/history.php?id=1&entryid=1"}]
    }
}}
<div class="table-responsive">
    <table class="generaltable">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">{{#str}} date, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col" class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{#str}} block, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col">{{#str}} daytitle, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col" class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{#str}} status, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col" class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{#str}} writtenon, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</th>
                <th scope="col"><span class="accesshide">{{#str}} actions {{/str}}</span></th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {{#rows}}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <span class="text-nowrap">{{date}}</span>
                        {{#late}}<div class="d-md-none"><span class="badge bg-warning text-dark text-wrap">{{late}}</span></div>{{/late}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{block}}</td>
                    <td class="text-break">
                        {{> mod_classprogress/log_session }}
                        <div class="d-md-none small">{{status}}</div>
                        {{#done}}<div class="small text-muted">{{done}}</div>{{/done}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{status}}</td>
                    <td class="d-none d-md-table-cell">{{writtenon}}{{#late}} <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">{{late}}</span>{{/late}}</td>
                    <td>
                        {{#canedit}}<a class="d-block d-md-inline py-1 py-md-0" href="{{editurl}}">{{#str}} editentry, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</a><span class="d-none d-md-inline"> · </span>{{/canedit}}<a class="d-block d-md-inline py-1 py-md-0" href="{{historyurl}}">{{#str}} history, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {{/rows}}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
